Modifications made by the QANIS fork
------------------------------------
QANIS has changed the original work. The changes are:

  * Rebranding: the application is now named "QANIS" (About screen,
    Android launcher label and app-title localisation strings). A line
    "Based on ProxyPin (Apache-2.0)" is kept on the About screen.
  * A new colour scheme with an amber primary accent (#E8A33D).
  * Restyled mobile traffic list, request detail screen and floating
    bubble overlay.
  * Application identity (package name / applicationId): the value
    currently shipped by this fork is recorded in README_FORK.md.

A description of the fork, the build instructions and the full list of
changes are in README_FORK.md.

